WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.827
In 914 the Sajid emir Yusuf
had King Smbat I put to death.

2
00:00:07.867 --> 00:00:10.604
But Smbat's son Ashot
would not yield.

3
00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:14.254
He drove the emir's men
from many of the strongholds

4
00:00:14.294 --> 00:00:15.564
they had seized.

5
00:00:15.604 --> 00:00:18.854
The Georgian king set
the crown of Armenia on his head,

6
00:00:18.894 --> 00:00:22.876
and Ashot came to be called
Erkat, the Iron.

7
00:00:23.116 --> 00:00:26.258
Hold the forest roads
of Tashir.

